f you in the tender mercies of Christ Jesus."},{"verse":9,"text":"This I pray, that your love may abound yet more and more in knowledge and all discernment,"},{"verse":10,"text":"so that you may approve the things that are excellent, that you may be sincere and without offense to the day of Christ,"},{"verse":11,"text":"being filled with the fruits of righteousness which are through Jesus Christ, to the glory and praise of God."},{"verse":12,"text":"Now I desire to have you know, brothers, that the things which happened to me have turned out rather to the progress of the Good News,"},{"verse":13,"text":"so that it became evident to the whole palace guard, and to all the rest, that my bonds are in Christ,"},{"verse":14,"text":"and that most of the brothers in the Lord, being confident through my bonds, are more abundantly bold to speak the word of God without fear."},{"verse":15,"text":"Some indeed preach Christ even out of envy and strife, and some also out of good will."},{"verse":16,"text":"The former insincerely preach Christ from selfish ambition, thinking that they add affliction to my chains;"},{"verse":17,"text":"but the latter out of love, knowing that I am appointed for the defense of the Good News."},{"verse":18,"text":"What does it matter? Only that in every way, whether in pretense or in truth, Christ is proclaimed. I rejoice in this, yes, and will rejoice."},{"verse":19,"text":"For I know that this will turn out to my salvation through your prayers and the supply of the Spirit of Jesus Christ,"},{"verse":20,"text":"according to my earnest expectation and hope, that I will in no way be disappointed, but with all boldness, as always, now also Christ will be magnified in my body, whether by life or by death."},{"verse":21,"text":"For to me to live is Christ, and to die is gain."},{"verse":22,"text":"But if I live on in the flesh, this will bring fruit from my work; yet I don’t know what I will choose."},{"verse":23,"text":"But I am hard pressed between the two, having the desire to depart and be with Christ, which is far better."},{"verse":24,"text":"Yet to remain in the flesh is more needful for your sake."},{"verse":25,"text":"Having this confidence, I know that I will remain, yes, and remain with you all for your progress and joy in the faith,"},{"verse":26,"text":"that your boasting may abound in Christ Jesus in me through my presence with you again."},{"verse":27,"text":"Only let your way of life be worthy of the Good News of Christ, that whether I come and see you or am absent, I may hear of your state, that you stand firm in one spirit, with one soul striving for the faith of the Good News;"},{"verse":28,"text":"and in nothing frightened by the adversaries, which is for them a proof of destruction, but to you of salvation, and that from God."},{"verse":29,"text":"Because it has been granted to you on behalf of Christ, not only to believe in him, but also to suffer on his behalf,"},{"verse":30,"text":"having the same conflict which you saw in me and now hear is in me."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/philippians.svg","availableLangs":["en","zh-CN"]},{"id":"philippians_2","bookSlug":"philippians","chapter":2,"reference":"Philippians 2","title":"Philippians 2 — Public Domain Study","topics":["philippians","philippians","nt","scripture","腓立比書","腓立比书","以基督的心為心","以基督的心为心"],"snippet":{"en":"If therefore there is any exhortation in Christ, if any consolation of love, if any fellowship of the Spirit, if any tender mercies and compassion,","zh-CN":"所以，在基督里若有什么劝勉，爱心有什么安慰，圣灵有什么交通，心中有什么慈悲怜悯，"},"tokens":{"30":2,"50":1,"philippians":10,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"nt":1,"scripture":1,"腓立比書":1,"腓立比书":2,"以基督的心為心":1,"以基督的心为心":1,"if":9,"therefore":6,"there":2,"is":5,"any":8,"exhortation":2,"in":26,"christ":8,"consolation":2,"of":31,"love":3,"fellowship":2,"the":35,"spirit":2,"tender":2,"mercies":2,"and":22,"compassion":2,"make":1,"my":6,"joy":2,"full":1,"by":1,"being":4,"like":2,"minded":2,"having":1,"sa