"夫几":1,"乎至":1,"至死":1,"死不":1,"不顾":1,"顾性":1,"性":1,"性命":1,"命要":1,"要补":1,"补":1,"补足":1,"足你":1,"们供":1,"不及":1,"及":1,"及之":1,"之处":1,"处":1},"verseMap":[{"verse":1,"text":"If therefore there is any exhortation in Christ, if any consolation of love, if any fellowship of the Spirit, if any tender mercies and compassion,"},{"verse":2,"text":"make my joy full by being like-minded, having the same love, being of one accord, of one mind;"},{"verse":3,"text":"doing nothing through rivalry or through conceit, but in humility, each counting others better than himself;"},{"verse":4,"text":"each of you not just looking to his own things, but each of you also to the things of others."},{"verse":5,"text":"Have this in your mind, which was also in Christ Jesus,"},{"verse":6,"text":"who, existing in the form of God, didn’t consider equality with God a thing to be grasped,"},{"verse":7,"text":"but emptied himself, taking the form of a servant, being made in the likeness of men."},{"verse":8,"text":"And being found in human form, he humbled himself, becoming obedient to the point of death, yes, the death of the cross."},{"verse":9,"text":"Therefore God also highly exalted him, and gave to him the name which is above every name,"},{"verse":10,"text":"that at the name of Jesus every knee should bow, of those in heaven, those on earth, and those under the earth,"},{"verse":11,"text":"and that every tongue should confess that Jesus Christ is Lord, to the glory of God the Father."},{"verse":12,"text":"So then, my beloved, even as you have always obeyed, not only in my presence, but now much more in my absence, work out your own salvation with fear and trembling."},{"verse":13,"text":"For it is God who works in you both to will and to work for his good pleasure."},{"verse":14,"text":"Do all things without complaining and arguing,"},{"verse":15,"text":"that you may become blameless and harmless, children of God without defect in the middle of a crooked and perverse generation, among whom you are seen as lights in the world,"},{"verse":16,"text":"holding up the word of life, that I may have something to boast in the day of Christ that I didn’t run in vain nor labor in vain."},{"verse":17,"text":"Yes, and if I am poured out on the sacrifice and service of your faith, I am glad and rejoice with you all."},{"verse":18,"text":"In the same way, you also should be glad and rejoice with me."},{"verse":19,"text":"But I hope in the Lord Jesus to send Timothy to you soon, that I also may be cheered up when I know how you are doing."},{"verse":20,"text":"For I have no one else like-minded, who will truly care about you."},{"verse":21,"text":"For they all seek their own, not the things of Jesus Christ."},{"verse":22,"text":"But you know that he has proved himself. As a child serves a father, so he served with me in furtherance of the Good News."},{"verse":23,"text":"Therefore I hope to send him at once, as soon as I see how it will go with me."},{"verse":24,"text":"But I trust in the Lord that I myself also will come shortly."},{"verse":25,"text":"But I thought it necessary to send to you Epaphroditus, my brother, fellow worker, fellow soldier, and your apostle and servant of my need,"},{"verse":26,"text":"since he longed for you all, and was very troubled because you had heard that he was sick."},{"verse":27,"text":"For indeed he was sick nearly to death, but God had mercy on him, and not on him only, but on me also, that I might not have sorrow on sorrow."},{"verse":28,"text":"I have sent him therefore the more diligently, that when you see him again, you may rejoice, and that I may be the less sorrowful."},{"verse":29,"text":"Receive him therefore in the Lord with all joy, and hold such people in honor,"},{"verse":30,"text":"because for the work of Christ he came near to death, risking his life to supply that which was lacking in your service toward me."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/philippians.svg","availableLangs":["en","zh-CN"]},{"id":"philippi