e":7,"text":"However, I consider those things that were gain to me as a loss for Christ."},{"verse":8,"text":"Yes most certainly, and I count all things to be a loss for the excellency of the knowledge of Christ Jesus, my Lord, for whom I suffered the loss of all things, and count them nothing but refuse, that I may gain Christ"},{"verse":9,"text":"and be found in him, not having a righteousness of my own, that which is of the law, but that which is through faith in Christ, the righteousness which is from God by faith,"},{"verse":10,"text":"that I may know him and the power of his resurrection, and the fellowship of his sufferings, becoming conformed to his death,"},{"verse":11,"text":"if by any means I may attain to the resurrection from the dead."},{"verse":12,"text":"Not that I have already obtained, or am already made perfect; but I press on, that I may take hold of that for which also I was taken hold of by Christ Jesus."},{"verse":13,"text":"Brothers, I don’t regard myself as yet having taken hold, but one thing I do: forgetting the things which are behind and stretching forward to the things which are before,"},{"verse":14,"text":"I press on toward the goal for the prize of the high calling of God in Christ Jesus."},{"verse":15,"text":"Let us therefore, as many as are perfect, think this way. If in anything you think otherwise, God will also reveal that to you."},{"verse":16,"text":"Nevertheless, to the extent that we have already attained, let’s walk by the same rule. Let’s be of the same mind."},{"verse":17,"text":"Brothers, be imitators together of me, and note those who walk this way, even as you have us for an example."},{"verse":18,"text":"For many walk, of whom I told you often, and now tell you even weeping, as the enemies of the cross of Christ,"},{"verse":19,"text":"whose end is destruction, whose god is the belly, and whose glory is in their shame, who think about earthly things."},{"verse":20,"text":"For our citizenship is in heaven, from where we also wait for a Savior, the Lord Jesus Christ,"},{"verse":21,"text":"who will change the body of our humiliation to be conformed to the body of his glory, according to the working by which he is able even to subject all things to himself."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/philippians.svg","availableLangs":["en","zh-CN"]},{"id":"philippians_4","bookSlug":"philippians","chapter":4,"reference":"Philippians 4","title":"Peace Beyond Understanding in Anxious Hours","topics":["anxiety","comfort","peace","joy","strength","prayer","gratitude","contentment","焦慮","焦虑","安慰","平安","喜樂"],"snippet":{"en":"Rejoice in the Lord always! Again I will say, “Rejoice!”","zh-CN":"你们要靠主常常喜乐。我再说，你们要喜乐。"},"tokens":{"11":1,"12":1,"13":1,"peace":5,"beyond":1,"understanding":2,"in":11,"anxious":2,"hours":1,"anxiety":1,"comfort":1,"joy":1,"strength":3,"prayer":3,"gratitude":1,"contentment":1,"焦慮":2,"焦虑":2,"安慰":2,"平安":3,"喜樂":2,"philippians":4,"rejoice":2,"the":6,"lord":4,"always":1,"again":1,"will":2,"say":1,"let":2,"your":6,"gentleness":1,"be":4,"known":2,"to":7,"all":3,"men":1,"is":8,"at":2,"hand":2,"nothing":1,"but":2,"everything":1,"by":1,"and":6,"petition":1,"with":4,"thanksgiving":2,"requests":1,"made":1,"god":3,"of":3,"which":1,"surpasses":1,"guard":2,"hearts":1,"thoughts":1,"christ":3,"jesus":1,"finally":1,"brothers":1,"whatever":7,"things":8,"are":6,"true":2,"honorable":2,"just":1,"pure":1,"lovely":2,"good":1,"report":1,"if":2,"there":2,"any":2,"virtue":1,"praise":1,"think":1,"about":1,"these":1,"not":3,"that":2,"speak":1,"because":3,"lack":1,"for":3,"have":1,"learned":1,"state":1,"am":1,"content":1,"it":2,"can":1,"do":1,"through":2,"who":2,"strengthens":2,"me":2,"腓立比书":1,"你们要靠主常常喜乐":1,"我再说":1,"你们要喜乐":1,"当叫众人知道你们谦让的心":1,"主已经近了":1,"应当一无挂虑":1,"只要凡事藉着祷告":1,"祈求":2,"和感谢":1,"将你们所要的告诉神":1,"神所赐":1,"出人意外的平安必在基督耶稣里保守你们的心怀意念":1,"弟兄们":1,"我还有未尽的话":1,"凡是真实的":1,"可敬的":1,"公义的":1,"清洁的":1,"可爱的":1,"有美名的":1,"若有什么德行":1,"若有什么称赞":1,"这些事你们都要思念":1,"我并不是因缺乏说这话":1,"我无论在什么景况都可以知足":1,"这是我已经学会了":1,"